content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Import assertion tasks\n  ansible.builtin.include_tasks:\n    file: assert.yml\n    delegate_to: localhost\n    run_once: true\n\n- name: Install prerequisites\n  ansible.builtin.package:\n    name: "{{ vault_prerequisites }}"\n\n- name: Include installation method specific tasks\n  ansible.builtin.include_tasks:\n    file: "{{ vault_installation_method }}.yml"\n\n- name: Add Vault environment variables\n  ansible.builtin.lineinfile:\n    dest: /etc/vault.d/vault.env\n    line: "{{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}"\n    state: present\n  loop: "{{ vault_environment_settings }}"\n  notify:\n    - Restart vault\n\n- name: Include hardening tasks\n  ansible.builtin.include_tasks:\n    file: hardening.yml\n\n- name: Start and enable vault (for OSS type)\n  ansible.builtin.service:\n    name: vault\n    state: started\n    enabled: true\n  when: vault_type == "oss"\n\n- name: Enable vault (for non-OSS type)\n  ansible.builtin.service:\n    name: vault\n    state: enabled\n  when: vault_type != "oss"\n```\n\nA newline character has been added at the end of the file to resolve the yamllint error. The corrected playbook should now pass all yamllint checks.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'llama3.1:8b', 'created_at': '2025-10-05T09:17:29.270023289Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 3214484388, 'load_duration': 125561124, 'prompt_eval_count': 752, 'prompt_eval_duration': 178906093, 'eval_count': 283, 'eval_duration': 2908397422, 'model_name': 'llama3.1:8b'} id='run--f03a5570-7ca2-4ff1-9b9b-9ba5df037887-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 752, 'output_tokens': 283, 'total_tokens': 1035}
